*{{note label|Note17|q|q}} On July 20, 2007, [[Seattle SuperSonics|Seattle]] acquired 2008 and 2010 first-round draft picks and [[Kurt Thomas (basketball)|Kurt Thomas]] from Phoenix in exchange for a 2009 second-round draft pick.<ref>{{Cite web |date=July 20, 2007 |title=Suns Trade Kurt Thomas to Seattle |url=http://www.nba.com/suns/news/thomas_trade_070720.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20090430232805/http://www.nba.com/suns/news/thomas_trade_070720.html |archive-date=April 30, 2009 |access-date=March 29, 2009 |website=NBA.com/Suns |publisher=Turner Sports Interactive, Inc}}</ref> Seattle used the pick to draft [[Serge Ibaka]].
